# Classes whose coverage follows thread timing (lane/covcache's proof,
# fresh JVM against fresh JVM): a run's data may lack a method that another
# run of the same tape takes. make selfcheck SELECT=1 runs every recording
# when a class whose internal name starts with one of these lines changes
# (tests/SelfSelect.java). A line with a dot names one method, Class.name
# (every overload): a change to it selects every recording.
# NetworkManager.setConnectionState on netty's loop against the server thread's compare
net/minecraft/network/NetHandlerPlayServer
net/minecraft/network/NetworkManager
# a reloaded chunk read back from its region file, or from the save still in flight
net/minecraft/nbt/
net/minecraft/world/chunk/storage/
net/minecraft/world/storage/ThreadedFileIOBase
net/minecraft/world/storage/IThreadedFileIO
netherite/oracle/ChunkIO
# outputPercentRemaining on a 1 s wall clock while the spawn area loads
net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer
# the skin loader's 2-thread executor and its callback on the client loop
net/minecraft/client/resources/SkinManager
net/minecraft/client/Minecraft
# Harness code a pool member runs once per JVM or outside the job's window
# (the first job's thread-local and static helpers, a job that takes the
# prelaunched world never calls launch itself): a pooled coverage run can
# lack a method a fresh JVM runs (lane/selfselect: pooled against fresh
# coverage of the same harness)
netherite/oracle/Oracle.launch
netherite/oracle/RowHash$1.initialValue
netherite/oracle/RowHash$2.<init>
netherite/oracle/RowHash$Hasher.<init>
